{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "109", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Answer:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.08997675810559722, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, when I was a kid, I wasn't really into museums, to be honest. I mean,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.7655784616807346, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they always felt kind of quiet and, you know, a bit boring for a little kid who just", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.8259902654606861, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "wanted to run around and have fun. But I do remember going on some school trips", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.8262077208877061, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to museums, and back then, I kind of enjoyed it just because I got to hang out with", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24630607605628574, "w": 0.8263189604625844, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "my classmates.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.16170340802173694, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.351061683680775, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Oh yes, there're a couple of them not far away from my place. For example,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.351061683680775, "w": 0.7658401053628445, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "there's a local history museum that showcases the area's development over the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.37939210919769767, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "years. It's an absolutely fascinating place to go if you're into history or want to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4077224592718353, "w": 0.825962481198205, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "know more about the region. And there's also an art museum that often holds", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4360528470673654, "w": 0.8258813839597454, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "exhibitions from contemporary artists. It's a great place to visit if you're fond of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46438319714150306, "w": 0.8260121032758466, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "modern art.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4927382924491278, "w": 0.12239682734479952, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.569126451009945, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think going to museums by myself is probably the best choice. I mean,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.569126451009945, "w": 0.7656726821132812, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "when I go alone, I can take my time and really lose myself in the exhibits I find", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5974568388054752, "w": 0.8257069890133234, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "interesting. There's no rush, no pressure to keep up with someone else's pace.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6257871888796128, "w": 0.8259247520152049, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Sometimes I even stop and read all the little signs next to the artwork, which is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6541176143965354, "w": 0.8262964049727474, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "something I probably wouldn't do if I were with friends.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6824850068781187, "w": 0.5611020786626809, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "4.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7588732408817209, "w": 0.025447283052840438, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think it's a pretty good idea to do so. I mean, museums kind of help", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.7588732408817209, "w": 0.7654915205199081, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you get a feel for the local culture. Like, you can learn about the city's past or see", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7872035909558586, "w": 0.8265557931058736, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "what kind of art people there care about. It's also a nice way to slow down during", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8155339410299962, "w": 0.8259030167249982, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a trip and just enjoy something different. So yeah, I wouldn't say it's a must, but", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8438643665469189, "w": 0.8257940326991037, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it's definitely worth checking out if you have time.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8722193864117586, "w": 0.508894885573437, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}